{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>宏福苑大火將近一年，喪失至親的家屬如何面對傷痛？李家原本三代同堂、一家七口，大火卻奪去四人，包括嫲嫲、爸爸、15個月大的欣欣，以及外傭。倖存的叔叔李俊豪、母親 Ali 與爺爺受訪時憶述，過去一年，他們透過整理遺物、接受精神科治療及到墳場拜祭等等，在悲痛中努力活下去，但喪親的創傷始終無法撫平。他們希望在宏福苑豎立紀念碑，為這場人禍，警惕後世。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>相關報道：<br/><br/><a href=\"http://google.com/url?q=https://bit.ly/4iL4wzG&amp;sa=D&amp;source=docs&amp;ust=1794767033267867&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IIDkZa4eaT69k9lJ4mEZD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑大火一年｜一家剩三口　墳前開「家庭會議」　苦笑、服藥負傷行　盼立碑悼亡者</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T01:10:03.219175+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":1,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T23:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T19:56:07.495694+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T01:03:14.443237+00:00","content_hash":"b1e4fabf99df210b51020d5c3a7d78fab3efbf943cf0927273a143603d87a8cb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}